# Map + physique

Map live : `DESERT_MAP_LAYOUT` (id `qasr-al-rih-ffa`).
`solid: true` → triangles FBX pour Rapier et hitscan.

## Checklist d'un changement de map

1. `public/js/world/desert-map-layout.js` — assets, `buildingScale`, `boundaryWall`.
2. `public/js/render/desert-world-renderer.js` — chargement FBX / textures.
3. `public/js/physics/rapier-physics.js` — colliders (souvent dérivés des meshes `solid`).
4. `server/src/FpsRoom.ts` — `SPAWN_POINTS`, `GRENADE_PICKUP_POINTS`.
5. `server/src/dev-bot-ai.ts` — waypoints + volumes d'occlusion.
6. `npm test` si la nav / LOS change.

`MAP_HALF_SIZE` (client) et les murs `boundaryWall.limit` / volumes bot doivent rester cohérents (playable ≈ 40).
